        },
        "quote": "(a) Operators shall park electric-assisted scooters on hard surfaces in either the frontage zone or amenity zone of the sidewalk; beside bicycle racks, transit stops or bike share stations; or in another area specifically designated for scooter parking, which will not in any way inhibit the pedestrian zone.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.35.050:block:0#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 10.35.050 block 1",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 1,
          "component_id": "061b493b-0465-5519-951a-c60a7712613f",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 428,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.35.050:block:1",
          "start": 309
        },
        "quote": "(b) It shall be unlawful for the operator of an electric-assisted scooter to engage in any of the following activities:",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.35.050:block:1#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 10.35.050 block 2",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 2,
          "component_id": "05f00c69-7732-5e2e-9ff3-9f13a2921108",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 495,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.35.050:block:2",
          "start": 429
        },
        "quote": "(1) Park in any street or in any area where parking is prohibited.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.35.050:block:2#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 10.35.050 block 3",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 3,
          "component_id": "16ce06e3-7b92-5701-a453-c4a8089fc8bf",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 570,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.35.050:block:3",
          "start": 496
        },
        "quote": "(2) Park on a sidewalk in such a manner that inhibits the pedestrian zone.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.35.050:block:3#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 10.35.050 block 4",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 4,
          "component_id": "bf246b05-5b82-53ce-9cb8-f01abaeefece",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 641,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.35.050:block:4",
          "start": 571
        },
        "quote": "(3) Park on private property without the written consent of the owner.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.35.050:block:4#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 10.35.050 block 5",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 5,
          "component_id": "5274f523-e0ea-5a50-a2f1-37231f0e0c7a",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 764,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.35.050:block:5",
          "start": 642
        },
        "quote": "(4) Park in a manner that would impede access to bike racks, including Topeka Metro Transit Authority bike share stations.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.35.050:block:5#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 10.35.050 block 6",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 6,
          "component_id": "c7b0f21e-ec81-56e2-a02f-41d1d3fa9bbb",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 857,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.35.050:block:6",
          "start": 765
        },
        "quote": "(5) Park in, or in a manner that would impede access to, or the use of any of the following:",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.35.050:block:6#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 10.35.050 block 7",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 7,
          "component_id": "e2d40e3a-faf7-55e0-adeb-90d20c3285c9",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 898,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.35.050:block:7",
          "start": 858
        },
        "quote": "(i) Buildings, parking lots, or garages;",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.35.050:block:7#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 10.35.050 block 8",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 8,
          "component_id": "b1dac953-a749-5544-af9c-2aacc889523c",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 949,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.35.050:block:8",
          "start": 899
        },
        "quote": "(ii) Motor vehicle driving lanes or bicycle lanes;",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.35.050:block:8#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 10.35.050 block 9",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 9,
          "component_id": "52f73da4-b1b8-589d-b726-471cba7d9e17",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1037,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.35.050:block:9",
          "start": 950
        },
        "quote": "(iii) Loading zones, disabled parking zones or designated parking spaces on the street;",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.35.050:block:9#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 10.35.050 block 10",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 10,
          "component_id": "b43b06e0-b44f-5535-8f43-e48b51007b6c",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1054,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.35.050:block:10",
          "start": 1038
        },
        "quote": "(iv) Curb ramps;",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.35.050:block:10#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 10.35.050 block 11",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 11,
          "component_id": "1247e442-3f37-586a-8b62-b5f21cc84033",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1102,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.35.050:block:11",
          "start": 1055
        },
        "quote": "(v) Entrances to private property or driveways;",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.35.050:block:11#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 10.35.050 block 12",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 12,
          "component_id": "39114181-aa88-5e7e-b03b-0a9edfce2f21",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1160,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.35.050:block:12",
          "start": 1103
        },
        "quote": "(vi) Transit zones, including bus stops and shelters; and",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.35.050:block:12#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 10.35.050 block 13",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 13,
          "component_id": "51337c34-d4b9-51c5-93a4-b14e01194570",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1243,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.35.050:block:13",
          "start": 1161
        },
        "quote": "(vii) Utility infrastructure, including traffic control devices and utility poles.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.35.050:block:13#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 10.35.050 block 14",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 14,
          "component_id": "580c2f93-83c0-51f6-a37b-7b774eb01395",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1469,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.35.050:block:14",
          "start": 1244
        },
        "quote": "(c) The Municipal Judge shall establish a schedule of fines to be imposed for violations of this section. The fines shall not exceed the amount established for traffic infractions related to parking. (Ord. 20178 § 4, 4-9-19.)",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.35.050:block:14#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
